<title>CHINA: Trading in Shum Yip shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Shum Yip shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Shum Yip Investment  Ltd was suspended on Friday at the company's request pending an announcement,  the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>The company's shares rose HK$0.35 or 4.17 percent to end at HK$8.75  on Thursday on volume of 16.79 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
